 scene now features a different animal, possibly a gazelle, running through a grassy field with two tropies, or trees, added next to it. The background remains the same with the mountainous terrain, but the animal and the trees have been introduced to the scene.', 'The image now shows a man sitting with a dog in front of trophies, with the puppies replaced by the man and dog.', 'The scene now depicts a single wild animal, likely a wolf, swimming in a pool, with no buffalo present.', 'The image now shows a small brown hamster inside a tube, with two small hamster babies nestled in a bed of mulch.', 'The final scene shows a clear bottle with a metallic top, containing a green liquid, and a decorative silver pendant hanging from the neck of the bottle.', 'The scene now shows a dog with a yellow bow sitting on the ground, while the other two dogs remain in their cage.']
