ues to hold the frying pan, now joined by another gorilla in the background, both eating. The foreground is filled with defocused leaves, creating a soft, blurred effect that adds depth to the image.', 'The image now shows a seal lying on a sandy beach with a camera attached to its head, its tongue sticking out playfully. The background remains the same with rocks and a cloudy sky, but there is no person or dog present in the scene.', "The final scene shows a tan rug placed underneath the black table, adding a warm, neutral base to the room's decor. The black table now sits on the rug, which contrasts nicely with the light-colored cushions and the wooden window frames. The natural light continues to stream through the windows, illuminating the room and highlighting the tan rug's placement.", 'The image now shows the same white binder with an additional open view on the right side, revealing the interior pages and the clear plastic sleeve, allowing a detailed look at the contents inside.', 'The scene now features a different background, with a clear blue sky and a beach setting, replacing the original forested backdrop. The house remains the same, with its thatched roof and wooden structure, but the overall atmosphere has shifted to a more serene coastal environment.', "The dog is now facing the camera, sitting on a lawn with a shadow effect cast over the ground, creating a dramatic contrast. The background remains a forested area with trees and grass, but the dog's position and the shadow effect are the key changes.", 'The scene now shows a single dog with a brown and white coat, lying on a brown sheet and looking directly at the camera. The dog is the only one present, and the background has been changed to a brown sheet, replacing the original setting.', 'The scene changes to a far-away shot of a Pomeranian walking on a garden surface, with the background now showing a clear sky and a broader view of the surroundings.']
