d in the image now has a patch of white fur on its chest and is looking to the left.', 'The marmot is now looking left, and the background has been changed to a seabed, with the marmot perched on a rock amidst some grass.', 'The image now shows plastic bottles instead of cans, all facing directly towards the camera, with a clean, white studio background.', 'The close-up photograph now features the pony with its fur changed to a light brown color, and the background is cleared of any people, focusing solely on the pony and its harness.', 'In the Target Image, the dog is sitting on its hind legs with its front paws raised, and its tongue is out, giving it a playful and relaxed appearance. The background remains the same, with the grassy field and trees providing a natural setting.']
