ose. The vending machines and refrigerators are replaced with a variety of duty-free goods, and the overall layout is more spacious and organized, reflecting a reputable showroom rather than a small duty-paid shop.', 'The black cabinet has been rotated to a different angle, and its color has been changed to a vibrant yellow. A flat-screen television has been added to the wall behind the cabinet, which is now set against a yellow backdrop.', 'The scene is now depicted as a straight view of a kitchen with white furnishings, replacing the previous salon setting. The white walls and floor create a clean, minimalist look, and the kitchen features white cabinets and countertops, with a large window allowing natural light to flood the space.', 'The image now shows a room with a mirror in the background, and hanging on the wall behind the mirror are different colored animals, such as a yellow bird and a blue fish, adding a playful and colorful element to the scene.', 'The scene now shows multiple pigs lying on the ground, replacing the original monkey. The pigs are scattered across the dirt area, with some lying close together and others spread out, maintaining the same natural setting with scattered leaves and branches in the background.']
