ioned on the opposite side of the frame, slightly angled to showcase its profile. The car is parked in front of the Park Ave BMW dealership in Maywood, NJ, with the same background of parked cars and the dealership's signage visible.", "The final scene shows a smaller plate with the same meal of fried chicken, mac and cheese, and a biscuit, but without the beverage and the fork. The sweet potato pie box is still present in the background, and the Bojangles' logo is visible on the tray.", 'The image now shows a different puppy with much lighter, fluffier fur sitting in the mulch of a pen.', 'The image now shows a person cutting biscuits, with the raw chicken and pot removed from the scene.', 'The scene now shows one tall dog sitting in the grass, with a man standing behind it in front of a door.', 'In the final scene, a flat-screen television has been added above the fireplace, replacing the previous decorative element. The rest of the room, including the dining table, chairs, bench, and kitchen area, remains unchanged.', 'The image now shows a close-up view of two red Starbucks cups with white lids, positioned on a wooden surface. The background is blurred, but an orange skyline is visible, suggesting a cityscape.']
