tside through the arched windows. The floor has been changed to a black and white pattern, contrasting with the warm tones of the wooden furniture and ceiling.', 'The scene now shows a soldier standing, holding a rifle, with a larger group of dogs, including a larger dog in the foreground, all positioned in front of him.', 'The bookshelf, now repurposed into lockers, remains in the same position as before but has been painted a different color, likely a shade of teal, and features numbered compartments.', 'The final scene features a series of predominantly black rectangular window blinds covering the large window, creating a sleek and modern look. The blinds are evenly spaced and allow some light to filter through, maintaining a balanced and sophisticated atmosphere in the room.', "The wolf's upper body is raised, and its head is tilted to the left, giving it a more alert appearance. The background has been changed to a clear blue sky, contrasting with the dry, grassy field below.", 'Three beagle puppies sit with their heads resting on each other on a red couch.', 'The image now shows bottles of lotion and shampoo lying on a carpet, replacing the previous bottles of beer. The bottles are arranged in a similar manner, with some stacked on top of others, and the labels are visible, indicating their contents.', 'The final scene shows two pink tubes of lotion side by side, with the original three tubes still present but now with the addition of the two pink tubes, creating a symmetrical arrangement on the pink background.', 'The Target Image shows a black Labrador Retriever with one missing limb that is already healed, standing on the grass. The dog is wearing a red bandage on the remaining leg, and a leash is attached to its collar.']
