ith one glass having a pinkish hue, another a darker red, and the third a lighter, almost orange color.', 'The image now shows a game stand instead of the two beer bottles, with the red and blue game stand occupying the space where the bottles were previously placed.', 'The kitchen now features a white island with light wood-colored countertops and white cabinets, contrasting with the original dark granite and wood tones. Chrome-colored appliances, such as the stove and oven, replace the previous stainless steel, giving the space a sleek, modern look.', 'The scene now features a single window with a vase of flowers on the windowsill, a single gray chair at a wooden table, and a bookshelf on the right. The chair at the table has been changed to brown, and the other chairs have been removed.', 'The final scene shows five Swell water bottles in black, pink, silver, blue, and red, each placed on a clear acrylic stand. The background is now a plain white, and the bottles are open, with the lids removed and placed beside them.', 'Above the wall with the screens, rectangular windows have been added, replacing the arched windows.']
